{
  "id": "layout.navbar",
  "kind": "block",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "category": "layout",
  "name": "navbar",
  "state": "stable",
  "knowledge": {
    "purpose": "Top-of-page navigation bar: logo, link list, and an optional right-aligned utility cluster. The persistent top chrome of a surface.",
    "useCases": [
      "Primary site header on a marketing surface",
      "App shell top bar with main nav links",
      "Logged-in dashboard header with profile CTA"
    ],
    "composesWith": [
      "layout.section",
      "control.link",
      "control.button",
      "platform/navigation"
    ],
    "antiPatterns": [
      "Side navigation — navbar is horizontal-only; use a layout.container with vertical links instead",
      "Embedding full forms inside the navbar — keep it lean (the built-in showSearch box is the only field that belongs here)",
      "Multiple navbars on the same surface",
      "Authoring `account` in a receipt or pattern — the runner injects the real visitor; a hand-written one is a fake session"
    ],
    "implementation": "Top-of-page navigation bar with logo, link list, and an optional right-aligned utility cluster (search box, social icons, an optional ghost/text secondary CTA followed by the primary CTA, avatar) plus a second co-brand wordmark — sticky-capable. Each link may carry EITHER a flat dropdown submenu (items: [{label, href}]) OR a multi-column mega-panel (megaColumns: [{heading?, items: [{label, href?, icon?, description?}]}] plus an optional trailing feature tile {title, description?, href?, icon?}). The cluster can also lead with a free info-slot (rightInfo: [{label?, value, icon?}]) of small muted non-interactive status text (e.g. weather '24°C London', currency 'USDTRY 27.01'), rendered before search/CTA. The secondary CTA pairs a ghost 'Log In' with a primary 'Get Started'.\n\nFurther use cases:\n- Sticky navbar that follows on scroll for long pages\n- Company portal top bar with search, social icons, and a co-branded second wordmark\n- Product/solutions mega-menu: a top-level link opening a wide multi-column panel of grouped destinations plus a highlighted feature tile\n- Portal header with a free info-slot showing live status (weather, exchange rate, server time) before the search box\n\nAccount control: when the runner injects `account`, the decorative avatar is replaced by the shared account menu (blocks/_shared-account-menu.tsx) — a WAI-ARIA menu button (aria-haspopup/expanded, arrow keys, Escape returns focus, outside press closes) opening a card with name + email, Profile (profileHref), `links`, a divider and Sign out. Signed out it renders a \"Sign in\" button. Sign in/out are emitted as block:click with payload.action {type: \"auth:signIn\" | \"auth:signOut\"}; the runner handles them (inert renders report the click without the action). `avatarName`/`avatarSrc` still work for static mock-ups without an account."
  },
  "definition": {
    "props": [
      {
        "name": "logoText",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "default": "",
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": ""
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "logoSrc",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "links",
        "type": "[{label, href, items?: [{label, href}], megaColumns?: [{heading?, items: [{label, href?, icon?, description?}]}], feature?: {title, description?, href?, icon?}}]",
        "required": false,
        "default": [],
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "href": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "items": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "label": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "href": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "label",
                    "href"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "megaColumns": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "heading": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "label": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "href": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "icon": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "description": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "label"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "items"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "feature": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "title": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "href": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "icon": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "title"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "label",
              "href"
            ]
          },
          "default": []
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "sticky",
        "type": "boolean",
        "required": false,
        "default": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "alignment",
        "type": "\"left\" | \"center\" | \"right\"",
        "required": false,
        "default": "right",
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "left",
            "center",
            "right"
          ],
          "default": "right"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "showCTA",
        "type": "boolean",
        "required": false,
        "default": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "ctaLabel",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "default": "",
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": ""
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "ctaHref",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "secondaryCtaLabel",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "secondaryCtaHref",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "backgroundColor",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "avatarName",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "avatarSrc",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "showSearch",
        "type": "boolean",
        "required": false,
        "default": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "searchPlaceholder",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "default": "Search…",
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "Search…"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "searchStateKey",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "State key the search query is written to when the visitor presses Enter — a data source filtering on {{state.<key>}} re-queries. The submit also emits a block:click event with payload {action:\"search\", value}."
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "socialLinks",
        "type": "[{icon, href}]",
        "required": false,
        "default": [],
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "icon": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "href": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "icon"
            ]
          },
          "default": []
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "secondaryLogoText",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "rightInfo",
        "type": "[{label?, value, icon?}]",
        "required": false,
        "default": [],
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "value": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "icon": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "value"
            ]
          },
          "default": []
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "logoHref",
        "type": "string",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Destination for the logo link; omitted, the logo renders unlinked.",
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bindable": false
      },
      {
        "name": "account",
        "type": "{state: 'signed-in' | 'signed-out', name?, email?, avatarSrc?, profileHref?, profileLabel?, links?: [{label, href}], signInLabel?, signOutLabel?}",
        "required": false,
        "jsonSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "state": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "signed-in",
                "signed-out"
              ]
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Display name (falls back to email)."
            },
            "email": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "avatarSrc": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "profileHref": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "App route of the profile page, already rewritten by the runner."
            },
            "profileLabel": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Localised label of the Profile menu entry. Default \"Profile\"; a folded bottom-bar tab keeps its own label."
            },
            "links": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "href": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "label",
                  "href"
                ]
              },
              "description": "Extra account-menu entries, listed after Profile."
            },
            "signInLabel": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Default \"Sign in\"."
            },
            "signOutLabel": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Default \"Sign out\"."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "state"
          ],
          "description": "The published app's visitor, INJECTED BY THE RUNNER — do not author it. Signed in: an avatar menu button (name beside it on wide screens) opening profile, links and sign out. Signed out: a \"Sign in\" button. Actions leave as payload.action {type:\"auth:signIn\"|\"auth:signOut\"}. Supersedes avatarName/avatarSrc."
        },
        "bindable": false
      }
    ],
    "defaultProps": {
      "logoText": "",
      "links": [],
      "sticky": false,
      "alignment": "right",
      "showCTA": false,
      "ctaLabel": "",
      "showSearch": false,
      "searchPlaceholder": "Search…",
      "socialLinks": [],
      "rightInfo": []
    },
    "canHaveChildren": false,
    "icon": "☰",
    "traits": []
  },
  "tags": [
